00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:29.030
It's something I've been really
curious about for a long time.

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:32.600
I've been at Google now a
little over six years, I think.

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:35.530
And for the first
few years I was here,

00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:37.960
I was a software engineer
on cloud storage.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:42.550
And at the end of my time there,
I was really curious about SRE.

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:44.460
And I nearly did a
mission control rotation,

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:48.320
but instead I decided to
turn left instead of right

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:52.240
and became a developer advocate
and ended up on a team with you

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:53.940
folks.

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:58.016
And so, a couple,
a few months back

00:04:58.016 --> 00:04:59.390
I was having a
great conversation

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:01.810
